  "contentHtml": "\n<p><img src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120228233224im_/http://img.banjig.net/d/bb/user_uploads/226598/image253_eac64f89.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></p><p>Энэ \nнэг бодлын харамсалтай</p><p>нэг талаараа \nхөгжилтэймаа. Монгол хэлний бичгийг ингэж доромжилж байгаа юм шиг бичих \nгэж. Бодвол эдний эзэд гэж монгол хүн лав байхгүй биз. Үнэхээр \nхарамсалтай албаар ингэж бичиж байгаа юм болов уу аль эвсэл боловсролын \nдоройтлоос болж ингэж бичсэн юм болов уу.<!--break--></p><p><img src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120228233224im_/http://img.banjig.net/d/bb/user_uploads/226598/image024_3ca385dd.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></p><p><img src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120228233224im_/http://img.banjig.net/d/bb/user_uploads/226598/image226_0217e92a.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></p><p><img src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120228233224im_/http://img.banjig.net/d/bb/user_uploads/226598/image070_8ea75223.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></p><p><img src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120228233224im_/http://img.banjig.net/d/bb/user_uploads/226598/image227_f2cdce9a.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></p><p><img src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120228233224im_/http://img.banjig.net/d/bb/user_uploads/226598/image228_fb3639ed.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><img src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120228233224im_/http://img.banjig.net/d/bb/user_uploads/226598/image229_8d61fa56.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><img src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120228233224im_/http://img.banjig.net/d/bb/user_uploads/226598/image230_6ddec756.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><img src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120228233224im_/http://img.banjig.net/d/bb/user_uploads/226598/image231_cd556b48.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><img src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120228233224im_/http: